                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Patients should only pay for the care they receive, not for the sign on the door or where they get treated.\n\nMy Same Care, Lower Cost Act would expand patients\u2019 health care options, create greater transparency, and reduce taxpayer burden.\n\nhttps://t.co/5kr5V3fRMX",
