                "text": "It\u2019s wrong for taxpayer-funded universities to prioritize the DEI agenda over merit in any program, but it\u2019s lethal to do this in medical schools.\n\nIt needs to stop. There is no reward for being stupid.\n\nRead my latest with @RepGregMurphy in @dcexaminer:\n\nhttps://t.co/69IeCf66kg",
