                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "\ud83e\uddf5 (1/13) Some medical schools place DEI above all else, even if it means worse outcomes for patients.\n\nThis obsession with racial quotas is destroying some of America\u2019s best medical schools.\n\nRead my latest with @RepGregMurphy in @dcexaminer:\n\nhttps://t.co/69IeCf66kg",
