                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 19,
                "retweet_count": 78,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "(2/13) According to whistleblowers, UCLA\u2019s top admissions officer turned away talented applicants because of their skin color.\n\nShe reportedly rejected one student because UCLA had \u201ctoo many of his kind.\u201d\n\nhttps://t.co/kCNkYegAQz",
