                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 18,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "(4/13) UCLA isn\u2019t alone. Harvard Medical School reportedly set exact percentages of minority and female faculty to hire\u201489% for women and 34% from minority groups that Harvard deemed worthy.\n\nThese quotas are immoral. They\u2019re also illegal.\n\nhttps://t.co/HuzAeSDNHu",
