                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 28,
                "retweet_count": 72,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "(12/13) It\u2019s wrong for universities, which are supported by American taxpayers, to prioritize the DEI agenda over merit in any academic program, but it\u2019s lethal to do this in medical schools. It needs to stop.\n\nThere is no reward for being stupid.",
