                "reply_count": 24,
                "retweet_count": 72,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "(13/13) When patients lie on the operating table, they don\u2019t care what their doctors look like or which political party they support. They just want a safe and successful operation.\n\nCongress should not stand by as this foolishness drives more medical schools into the ground.",
